  "details": "Whether the group is set to open join, request to join, or invite only. I want to be able to set filters that only allow specific trust ranks to join, apply, or be invited. Meaning if I only wanted Trusted, Known, and User to be able to join my group. Also I'd like a mass kick/removal function like getting rid of all visitors from the group, or all  new user, all users, etc. \n\nThese two ideas and updates would allow most groups to stay open join, and filter out alt accounts, trolls, rage baiters, crashers, and malicious people with malicious intent, not completely but it would help greatly. These two ideas would give more function to the vrchat trust rank as well.",
